    ItemId: 
    GameId: 
    RewardId: 
    Score: 
    BranchName: 
    Branchs: []
    Dialogues:
    - Content: Hello,I've searched many times and I still can't find a book that
        documents ancient puzzles.
      Speaker: Magica apprentice
      BreakType: 0
      Tag: 
      Reward: 
      Choices: []
    - Content: And I'm guessing it's probably on one of the higher shelves in the
        library where I cannot get .
      Speaker: Magica apprentice
      BreakType: 0
      Tag: 
      Reward: 
      Choices: []
    - Content: Would you mind help me look for it in the library?
      Speaker: Magica apprentice
      BreakType: 0
      Tag: 
      Reward: 
      Choices:
      - Content: Yes, i will go and have a look.
        NextDialogIndex: 3
        Score: 0
      - Content: "why not use kind of floating magic or  a ledder\uFF1F"
        NextDialogIndex: 4
        Score: 0
    - Content: Thank you so much! I'll be here till you get back.
      Speaker: Magica apprentice
      BreakType: 1
      Tag: 
      Reward: key
      Choices: []
    - Content: Well.. you are right.
      Speaker: Magica apprentice
      BreakType: 3
      Tag: More than helping others, provided practical ideas for the magical apprentice.
        She took the book with her floating magic, and managed to pass the Enchantress
        Exam after carefully studying that book.
      Reward: 
      Choices: []
    OnFinish:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - Name: "\u5BFB\u627E\u4E66\u672C"
    m_Type: 0
    ItemId: ancient puzzle book
    GameId: 
    RewardId: 
    Score: 
    BranchName: 
    Branchs: []
    Dialogues:
    - Content: Haven't you been able to find it yet? That's okay. I guess it's on
        the upper shelf. I'll be waiting for you when you get back.
      Speaker: Magica apprentice
      BreakType: 2
      Tag: 
      Reward: 
      Choices: []
    OnFinish:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - Name: "\u4EA4\u4E66"
    m_Type: 1
    ItemId: 
    GameId: 
