    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Even though I defeated the Demon King and restored peace to the world
    years ago, I still feel a duty to guard it. That''s why, upon my return from
    the Demon World, I placed Excalibur back in the village and vowed to protect
    it until my dying breath.


    It brings me joy to see young people becoming
    adventurers and embracing bravery as their guiding principle. I hope that someday
    in the future, if the world faces crisis again, a new adventurer will come here,
    draw Excalibur, and save the world.'
